title: What you must do.
pid: bef754d3-f7af-433c-ae8a-04e7aa744e30
body: |2-
  - Restart the pacer when you have read this: the running one has the
    old script open and will not update the account.
  - Lend minds with 'specialist.sh prompt NAME MISSION_ID KIND'; without
    KIND, or with another word, it prints nothing and exits 2. Your note
    "lending the mind" (e4009305) still shows the two-word form; it is
    yours, so I did not fork it.
  - The prompt now says 'save' and 'commit' refuse '--out-dir' and take
    only '--port'. That also does your other mission, "Have the
    specialist's prompt stop saying every command takes '--out-dir'"
    (f417b5ea), if it is not yet lent.
